# Public health data

- Fetch in a dedicated module or hook, not inside JSX.
- Normalize nested or missing fields before the component sees them.
- Paginate on the server when the API supports it. Keep the page in the URL.
- Type the error and show a sentence a person can act on. Offer a retry.
- Say what the figure is, the year or status it covers, and what it is not.

```tsx
<p>
  Age-adjusted prevalence for this county in {place.year}. This is a population
  estimate, not a diagnosis.
</p>
```
